  "details": "No matter what, I figure a world will take 30-45 seconds to load for me, and I don't need a notification to know that amount of time has gone by.\n\nMost of the time I would use this feature while browsing the world menu, adding a handful to hop to and explore. The constant notifications popping up during browsing is distracting. \n\nI've never really got much into using the preload feature, knowing that I'll just have to clear a bunch of notifications - a bit counterintuitive if the feature is supposed to save you time. \n\nPlease make a toggle to disable the preload complete notification.",
